  "title": "SRT: Fix malformed packet error for control packets without CIF",
  "description": "KEEPALIVE, CGWARNING, SHUTDOWN, ACKACK, and PEERERROR control packets\nhave no Control Information Field beyond the 16-byte header. The dissector\nwas incorrectly trying to read 4 additional bytes at offset 16, causing\n'Malformed Packet' errors.\n\nReference: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-sharabayko-srt-01",
